  "description": "Find all the mode(s) (the most frequently occurred element) in a given binary search tree.",
  "pseudocode": "1: let modes = [], maxCount = 0, currCount = 0, prev = null\n2: function traverse(node) {\n3:   if (!node) return\n4:   traverse(node.left)\n5:   currCount = (node.val === prev) ? currCount + 1 : 1\n6:   if (currCount === maxCount) modes.push(node.val)\n7:   else if (currCount > maxCount) { modes = [node.val]; maxCount = currCount }\n8:   prev = node.val\n9:   traverse(node.right)\n10: }",
